return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'sw','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:05+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T21:12:05+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'Inaunganisha tovuti hii ya WordPress na Zinn Digital® ili vifungu vilivyopangwa viweze kuchapishwa humo. Bandika msimbo wa kuoanisha kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn® na programu-jalizi huweka kitambulisho chake yenyewe — hakuna kinachonakiliwa kwa mkono.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Imehifadhiwa. Andika thamani mpya ili kuichukua nafasi yake.','Filter this list…'=>'Chuja orodha hii…','Filter this list'=>'Chuja orodha hii','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Hakuna kinacholingana na kichujio hicho.','Add a row'=>'Ongeza safu','Remove this row'=>'Ondoa safu hii','Remove'=>'Ondoa','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — muhtasari','Overview'=>'Muhtasari','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Kila programu jalizi ya Zinn® kwenye tovuti hii, na kama inafanya kazi.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Hakuna muunganisho unaohitajika kwa programu-jalizi hii.','Open settings'=>'Fungua mipangilio','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Huna ruhusa ya kubadilisha mipangilio hii.','Settings sections'=>'Sehemu za mipangilio','Support'=>'Usaidizi','Save changes'=>'Hifadhi mabadiliko','Tools'=>'Zana','Export settings'=>'Hamisha mipangilio','Reset to defaults'=>'Weka upya kwa chaguo-msingi','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Hii inarudisha kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii katika hali yake ya awali. Uendelee?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Utambuzi kwa ajili ya usaidizi','Import a settings file'=>'Leta faili ya mipangilio','Import'=>'Ingiza','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faili zilizosafirishwa haziwahi kuwa na nywila, ishara au funguo za API — utahitaji kuingiza tena kwenye tovuti mpya.','Settings saved.'=>'Mipangilio imehifadhiwa.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Kila mpangilio kwenye programu-jalizi hii umerudi kwenye hali yake ya kwanza.','Done.'=>'Imekamilika.','That action is not available.'=>'Kitendo hicho hakipatikani.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa. Chochagua faili ya mipangilio iliyosafirishwa kutoka kwa programu jalizi ya Zinn®.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo ni kubwa mno kuwa usafirishaji wa mipangilio.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faili hiyo sio usafirishaji wa mipangilio ya Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faili hiyo ilisafirishwa kutoka kwa programu-jalizi nyingine (%s), kwa hivyo kuileta hapa kutahifadhi mipangilio ambayo programu-jalizi hii haielewi.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'Mpangilio %d umeingizwa. Nywila na funguo za API haziingizwi kamwe kwenye ripoti, kwa hivyo ziingize tena.' . "\0" . 'Mipangilio %d imeletwa. Nywila na funguo za API haziwahi kuwepo kwenye usafirishaji nje, kwa hiyo ziingize tena.','The archive would be %1$d MB, over the %2$d MB limit set on this site. Raise the limit, or exclude some folders, on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups screen.'=>'Hifadhi hiyo itakuwa MB %1$d, zaidi ya kikomo cha MB %2$d kilichowekwa kwenye tovuti hii. Ongeza kikomo, au tenga folda fulani, kwenye skrini ya Zinn Digital® → Connector → Backups.','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP ya tovuti hii haiwezi kuunda kumbukumbu, kwa hiyo chelezo haikuweza kutengenezwa.','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'Imeshindikana kuunda faili la muda.','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'Faili za tovuti hii hazikuweza kuwekwa kwenye kumbukumbu.','This site\'s PHP cannot compress archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP ya tovuti hii haiwezi kubana kumbukumbu, kwa hiyo nakala rudufu haikuweza kufanywa.','A backup of this site needs about %1$s of temporary space and only %2$s is free, so it was not attempted.'=>'Hifadhi rudufu ya tovuti hii inahitaji takriban %1$s ya nafasi ya muda na ni %2$s pekee iliyo wazi, kwa hivyo haikujaribiwa.','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'Mtumiaji huyu wa WordPress hawezi kuchapisha machapisho, kwa hiyo muunganisho uliotengenezwa sasa hauwezi kuchapisha pia. Ingia kama mtumiaji anayeweza kuchapisha, kisha ujaribu tena.','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Nywila za programu zimezimwa kwenye tovuti hii, kwa hiyo hatuwezi kuunda kitambulisho. Mwombe mwenyeji wako aziwashe, au unganisha tovuti kwa kutumia nywila unayojiundia mwenyewe kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®.','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress haikuwezi kuunda kitambulisho cha tovuti hii. Hakuna kilichotumwa popote.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'Hatukuweza kufika Zinn Digital® kutoka kwenye tovuti hii. Hakuna kilichounganishwa, و utambulisho tuliounda umeondolewa. Hakikisha kuwa tovuti inaweza kufanya maombi ya kutoa data, kisha jaribu tena.','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikukubali msimbo huo wa uoanishaji. Hakuna kilichounganishwa. Tengeneza msimbo mpya kwenye dashibodi yako na ujaribu tena.','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'Imeunganishwa. Zinn Digital® sasa inaweza kuchapisha kwenye tovuti hii.','Connected'=>'Imeunganishwa','Connecting…'=>'Inaunganisha…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini kuna kitu kinahitaji umakini','Not connected'=>'Haijaunganishwa','Running on your own account'=>'Inaendeshwa kwenye akaunti yako mwenyewe','We could not check this'=>'Hatukuweza kuangalia hili','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Programu jalizi hii haijasema kwa nini. Tuma ripoti ya uchunguzi na tutaichunguza.','Connection status'=>'Hali ya muunganisho','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Mara ya mwisho kukaguliwa ilikuwa %s iliyopita.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(inafungua kwenye kichupo kipya)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma hii kwa usaidizi wa Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Hiki ndicho kitakachotumwa hasa — hakuna kingine, na hakuna kilichofichwa. Nenosiri lako, ishara (tokens), na funguo za API hazimo ndani yake.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Ripoti ya uchunguzi itakayotumwa','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nakili kwenye ubao klipu','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'Tuma ripoti hii kwa msaada wa Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Tunakufungulia tiketi ya usaidizi na kukujibu kupitia barua pepe. Ikiwa hutaki kuituma, nakili hapo juu na uiweke kwenye tiketi wewe mwenyewe.','Copied'=>'Imenakopwa','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Hatukuweza kufika Zinn Digital® kutoka kwa seva hii (%s). Nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu na ufungue tikiti badala yake — hakuna chochote kuhusu mipangilio yako kilicho kibaya.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® umepokea ripoti yako na utajibu kwa barua pepe.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Usaidizi wa Zinn® una ripoti yako — rejeleo %s — na utajibu kupitia barua pepe.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Umetuma ripoti kadhaa kwa muda mfupi. Subiri dakika chache kisha ujaribu tena — zile za awali ziliwasili.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® haikuweza kupokea ripoti hiyo kwa sasa — hilo ni tatizo letu, sio lako. Jaribu tena hivi karibuni, au nakili ripoti iliyo hapo juu kwenye tiketi.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Ripoti imekataliwa (HTTP %d). Iiga juu na ufungue tikiti, ukitaja nambari hiyo.','This site’s owner has turned off image uploads for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Mmiliki wa tovuti hii amezima upakiaji wa picha kwa ajili ya Zinn Digital® katika mipangilio ya Zinn® Connector.','This site’s owner has turned off edits to existing articles for Zinn Digital® in the Zinn® Connector settings.'=>'Mmiliki wa tovuti hii amezima uhariri wa makala zilizopo za Zinn Digital® katika mipangilio ya Zinn® Connector.','New article on your site: %s'=>'Makala mpya kwenye tovuti yako: %s','Zinn Digital® has added an article to your site.

Title: %1$s
Edit it: %2$s
Status: %3$s

Turn these emails off on the Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing screen.'=>'Zinn Digital® imeongeza makala kwenye tovuti yako.

Kichwa: %1$s
Ihariri: %2$s
Hali: %3$s

Zima barua pepe hizi kwenye skrini ya Zinn Digital® → Connector → Publishing.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — miongozo na huduma','User guides'=>'Miongozo ya watumiaji','Read the %s user guide'=>'Soma mwongozo wa mtumiaji wa %s','Hide this'=>'Ficha hii','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Hosting ya Zinn® kwa ajili ya WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, nakala rudufu za kila siku, uhamiaji wa bure na kidhibiti kilichoundwa kwa ajili ya watu wanaoendesha zaidi ya tovuti moja.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Soko la Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Nunua na uuze tovuti zilizopo, vikoa na uwekaji wa viungo, huku pesa zikiwekwa kwa usalama hadi pande zote mbili ziwe na furaha.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — ajiri wataalamu wanaofanya hili kwa ajili ya maisha','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Soko letu la kimataifa la wafanyakazi huru: vinjari huduma zaidi ya 10,000 zilizotengenezwa tayari kutoka kwa waandishi, wabunifu, watengenezaji na wataalamu wa SEO, au chapisha mradi na uwaruhusu watoe zabuni.','Connector'=>'Kiunganishi','Connection'=>'Muunganisho','Publishing'=>'Inachapisha','Backups'=>'Nakala rudufu','Advanced'=>'Ya Juu','Check the connection now'=>'Angalia muunganisho sasa','Disconnect this site'=>'Tenganisha tovuti hii','This revokes the credential Zinn Digital® uses, so we can no longer publish to this site. Anything already published stays. Continue?'=>'Hii inabatilisha kitambulisho kinachotumiwa na Zinn Digital®, ili tusiweze tena kuchapisha kwenye tovuti hii. Kila kitu kilichochapishwa tayari kinabaki. Kuendelea?','What we may do on this site'=>'Tunaweza kufanya nini kwenye tovuti hii','The credential we hold is an ordinary WordPress application password, so WordPress itself decides what is possible. These narrow it further, on your side.'=>'Kitambulisho tulicho nacho ni nenosiri la kawaida la programu ya WordPress, kwa hivyo WordPress yenyewe ndiyo inayoamua kile kinachowezekana. Haya yanapunguza zaidi, kwa upande wako.','Publish articles as'=>'Chapisha makala kama','Choose “a draft” if you would rather read everything before it goes live.'=>'Chagua "rasimu" ikiwa unapendelea kusoma kila kitu kabla hakijachapishwa.','Published straight away'=>'Imechapishwa mara moja','A draft, for me to review'=>'Rasimu, ili niipitie','Pending review'=>'Inasubiri ukaguzi','Scheduled, using the date we send'=>'Imepangwa, kwa kutumia tarehe tunayotuma','Show the author as'=>'Onyesha mwandishi kama','Which of your users appears as the author. This does not change who we sign in as.'=>'Ni yupi kati ya watumiaji wako anayeonekana kama mwandishi. Hii haibadilishi ni nani tunayeingia kama yeye.','Put articles in'=>'Weka makala katika','Allow images'=>'Ruhusu picha','Let Zinn Digital® upload images into this site’s media library'=>'Ruhusu Zinn Digital® ipakie picha kwenye maktaba ya media ya tovuti hii','Turn this off and articles arrive without their images. Nothing already uploaded is removed.'=>'Zima hii na makala hufika bila picha zake. Hakuna kitu kilichopakiwa tayari kinachoondolewa.','Allow edits'=>'Ruhusu mabadiliko','Let Zinn Digital® update an article it published before'=>'Ruhusu Zinn Digital® isasishe makala iliyochapishwa hapo awali','Used for corrections and re-optimisation. It never touches anything you wrote yourself.'=>'Inatumika kwa marekebisho na uboreshaji upya. Haiwahi kugusa chochote ulichokiandika mwenyewe.','Tell me when something is published'=>'Niambie wakati kitu kimechapishwa','Leave blank for no email. One message per article, from your own site.'=>'Acha wazi kwa kutumia barua pepe yoyote. Ujumbe mmoja kwa kila makala, kutoka kwenye tovuti yako mwenyewe.','Off-site backups'=>'Hifadhi rudufu za nje ya tovuti','This site sends its own backup straight to Zinn® storage. Nothing passes through our servers on the way.'=>'Tovuti hii inatuma nakala rudufu yake moja kwa moja kwenye hifadhi ya Zinn®. Hakuna kinachopitia kwenye seva zetu wakati huo.','Back this site up to Zinn Digital®'=>'Hifadhi nakala ya tovuti hii kwenda Zinn Digital®','Backup token'=>'Token ya hifadhi rudufu','Set for you when the site was connected. You will only need to touch this if support asks.'=>'Imewekwa kwa ajili yako wakati tovuti ilipounganishwa. Utahitaji tu kugusa hii ikiwa usaidizi utauliza.','Leave these out'=>'Acha haya','One path per line, relative to wp-content — for example <code>cache</code> or <code>uploads/backups</code>. Caches and other backup plugins’ folders are the usual candidates.'=>'Njia moja kwa kila mstari, inayohusiana na wp-content — kwa mfano <code>cache</code> au <code>uploads/backups</code>. Akiba (caches) na folda za programu-jalizi nyingine za chelezo ni chaguo za kawaida.','Stop if the archive would exceed'=>'Simama ikiwa kumbukumbu itazidi','Megabytes. A shared host will usually kill a very large archive part-way; a bound turns that into a message instead of a silent failure.'=>'Megabaiti. Seva ya pamoja kwa kawaida itakatisha kumbukumbu kubwa sana katikati; kikomo hubadilisha hilo kuwa ujumbe badala ya kushindwa kimya kimya.','Detailed logging'=>'Ukataji miti wa kina','Record what this plugin does, for support'=>'Rekodi kile ambacho programu-jalizi hii inafanya, kwa ajili ya usaidizi','Kept on this site, capped at the last 50 entries, and included in a diagnostics report. Turn it on before reproducing a problem.'=>'Imewekwa kwenye tovuti hii, ukomo wa maingizo 50 ya mwisho, na imejumuishwa kwenye ripoti ya utambuzi. Iwashe kabla ya kuzalisha upya tatizo.','On uninstall'=>'Wakati wa kusanidua','Delete this plugin’s settings when it is uninstalled'=>'Futa mipangilio ya programu-jalizi hii inapoondolewa','Uninstalling never revokes the application password — that is deliberate, so uninstalling to try something else does not break your publishing. Use Disconnect above if you want the credential gone.'=>'Kupakua hakufuti kamwe nenosiri la programu — hilo ni la makusudi, ili kupakua ili ujaribu kitu kingine kusisitize uchapishaji wako. Tumia Tenganisha hapo juu ikiwa unataka kitambulisho hicho kiwe kimeondolewa.','The user we sign in as'=>'Mtumiaji tunayeingia naye','The site’s default category'=>'Kitengo chaguomsingi cha tovuti','Connect this site again'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii tena','Connect this site'=>'Unganisha tovuti hii','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'Fungua dashibodi yako ya Zinn Digital®, nenda kwenye Yadi ya Maudovu → Tovuti zingine, na ubonyeze “Pata nambari ya kuoanisha”. Ibandike hapa chini.','Connecting again creates a fresh credential and leaves the old one in place — use Disconnect first if you want the old one gone.'=>'Kuunganisha tena kunaunda kitambulisho kipya na kuacha cha zamani mahali pake — tumia Tenganisha kwanza ikiwa unataka kile cha zamani kiondolewe.','Pairing code'=>'Msimbo wa kuoanisha','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'Inaisha muda wa dakika theluji tatu baada ya kuitengeneza, na inaweza kutumika mara moja tu.','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'Huruhusu kuunganisha tovuti hii.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Tovuti hii haijaunganishwa na Zinn Digital®.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Get a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and paste it below.'=>'Hakuna tatizo — haijaoanishwa tu bado. Pata msimbo wa kuoanisha kutoka kwenye dashibodi yako ya Zinn® kisha ubandike hapa chini.','Open my Zinn® dashboard'=>'Fungua dashibodi yangu ya Zinn®','The connection is broken.'=>'Muunganisho umekatika.','The WordPress user the credential belonged to (%s) no longer exists on this site, so nothing we send can be published. Connect again as a user who can publish.'=>'Mtumiaji wa WordPress ambaye kitambulisho kilikuwa chake (%s) hayupo tena kwenye tovuti hii, kwa hiyo hakuna kinachoweza kuchapishwa tunachotuma. Unganisha tena kama mtumiaji anayeweza kuchapisha.','The “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password has been deleted from this site, so we can no longer sign in. Connect again to create a new one — nothing else was lost.'=>'Nenosiri la programu ya “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” limefutwa kwenye tovuti hii, kwa hivyo hatuwezi tena kuingia. Unganisha tena ili uunde jipya — hakuna kingine kilichopotea.','See this site’s application passwords'=>'Tazama nywila za programu za tovuti hii','Connected, but publishing would fail.'=>'Imeunganishwa, lakini uchapishaji utashindwa.','The credential belongs to %s, and that user can no longer publish posts. Sign-in still works, so nothing looks wrong until an article is due. Give that user the ability to publish, or connect again as somebody who can.'=>'Kitambulisho hiki ni cha %s, na mtumiaji huyo hana tena ruhusa ya kuchapisha makala. Kuingia kwenye mfumo bado kunawezekana, kwa hivyo hakuna kinachoonekana vibaya hadi wakati wa kuchapisha makala utakapofika. Mpe mtumiaji huyo uwezo wa kuchapisha, au uunganishe tena kama mtu mwingine mwenye ruhusa hiyo.','Edit that user'=>'Hariri mtumiaji huyo','Connected here — we could not reach Zinn Digital® to confirm.'=>'Imeunganishwa hapa — hatukuweza kufika Zinn Digital® ili kuthibitisha.','Connected, but your Zinn® account needs attention.'=>'Umeunganishwa, lakini akaunti yako ya Zinn® inahitaji umakini.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Imeunganishwa na Zinn Digital®.','Connected to Zinn Digital® as %s.'=>'Imeunganishwa na Zinn Digital® kama %s.','Publishing as'=>'Inachapishwa kama','Zinn® site ID'=>'Kitambulisho cha tovuti cha Zinn®','This server could not reach api.zinndigital.com (%s). That is usually a firewall or an outbound-connection rule on your host, not a problem with your Zinn® account — publishing may still be working.'=>'Seva hili halikuweza kufikia api.zinndigital.com (%s). Hilo kwa kawaida ni ngome ya mtandao au sheria ya muunganisho wa nje kwenye seva yako, sio tatizo na akaunti yako ya Zinn® — kuchapisha kunaweza bado kuwa kunafanya kazi.','Zinn Digital® answered with an error of its own — that is our end, not yours. Publishing is unaffected while this clears.'=>'Zinn Digital® imejibu kwa kosa lake yenyewe — hilo ni upande wetu, si wako. Kuchapisha hakutaathiriwa wakati hili linasuluhishwa.','Your Zinn® account is not currently able to publish to this site. Your dashboard says why.'=>'Akaunti yako ya Zinn® kwa sasa haiwezi kuchapisha kwenye tovuti hii. Dashibodi yako inaonyesha sababu.','Zinn Digital® answered HTTP %d, which we do not recognise. Send a diagnostics report from the Support tab and we will look — do not change anything here first.'=>'Zinn Digital® imejibu HTTP %d, ambayo hatuitambui. Tuma ripoti ya utambuzi kutoka kwa kichupo cha Usaidizi na tutachunguza — usibadilishe chochote hapa kwanza.','Check again now'=>'Angalia tena sasa','Checked. The connection is live.'=>'Imekagわれています. Muunganisho uko hai.','We could not remove the application password, so this site is still connected. Delete “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” on your profile screen and try again — we have changed nothing.'=>'Hatukuweza kuondoa nenosiri la programu, kwa hivyo tovuti hii bado imeunganishwa. Futa “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” kwenye skrini yako ya wasifu kisha ujaribu tena — hatujabadilisha chochote.','Disconnected. The application password has been revoked, so Zinn Digital® can no longer publish to this site. Nothing already published was touched.'=>'Imekatishwa muunganisho. Nenosiri la programu limebatilishwa, kwa hivyo Zinn Digital® haiwezi tena kuchapisha kwenye tovuti hii. Hakuna kilichochapishwa tayari kilichoguswa.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Faili hiyo haikuweza kusomwa kutoka kwenye seva hii, kwa hiyo hakuna kilichopakiwa.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Tovuti hii haikuweza kutiririsha upakiaji huo, kwa hivyo hakuna kilichotumwa.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Faili hili ni %1$s na PHP ya tovuti hii haina cURL, kwa hivyo kubwa zaidi inayoweza kupakia ni %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'Upakiaji haukuweza kukamilika.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Hifadhi imekataa upakiaji (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Muundo uliowekwa tayari','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Mahali pa kuanzia. Chochote kilicho hapa chini kinabatilisha hili.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Tumia rangi na saizi zangu mwenyewe','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Acha hii ikiwa imezimwa na mpangilio wa awali utatumika jinsi ulivyo.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Tazama maelezo ya toleo la Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Sasisho lililopakuliwa limeshindwa ukaguzi wa uadilifu na halijasakinishwa.']];